<title>POLAND: ECHO OCT NET JUMPS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>ECHO OCT NET JUMPS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.53 vs   0.03</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.93 vs   0.05</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.95 vs   0.07</p>
<p> Sales		    1.88 vs   0.70</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.16 vs   0.37</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.93 vs   0.62</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.99 vs   0.48</p>
<p> Sales		   13.82 vs   5.68</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish developer is Echo Investment SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
